        {
          "text": "Nao manengwa kĩla ũmwe ngũa nzaũ ndasa; na matavw’a mathũmũange kavinda kanini, kũvika yĩla atethya ma wĩa vamwe nao na ana‐a‐asa moo, ala meũawa o ũndũ mo mooaiwe, methĩwe meanĩtye ũtalo woo.",
          "type": "text",
