        {
          "text": "Na noona akyũmbũa ũsiĩlo wa thanthatũ, na kwaĩ kĩtetemo kĩnene kya nthĩ; na syũa yatw’ĩka yiũ ta ĩkunia ya w’ĩa, na mwei w’onthe watw’ĩka ta nthakame; ",
